WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:03.020
Hi, Mystery Recapped here.

00:00:03.020 --> 00:00:08.310
Today I am going to explain the Japanese film
called “The Taste Of Tea.”

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:09.660
Spoilers ahead!

00:00:09.660 --> 00:00:17.430
Watch out and take care!

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:23.210
The movie revolves around the Haruno family
who lives in a small village in Japan.

00:00:23.210 --> 00:00:29.039
At the beginning of the movie, the grandfather
plays with the youngest daughter Sachiko Haruno.

00:00:29.039 --> 00:00:34.109
As the little girl sits alone behind her,
we see her doppelganger double the size of

00:00:34.109 --> 00:00:35.109
her.

00:00:35.109 --> 00:00:40.360
Sachiko has been troubled by this massive
form of herself following her around.

00:00:40.360 --> 00:00:45.300
She thinks of ways to get rid of it often
but has never actually tried anything.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:50.129
One day at school, she is in the morning assembly
yawning because she is bored.

00:00:50.129 --> 00:00:55.510
At the same time, she sees her larger self
sitting on the bars and yawning as well.

00:00:55.510 --> 00:01:01.800
In the classroom, Sachiko dives into her thoughts
and thinks of ways to get rid of the giant.

00:01:01.800 --> 00:01:07.230
She remembers a story her uncle Ayano had
told her and her brother a few years back.

00:01:07.230 --> 00:01:13.070
When Ayano was just a boy, there used to be
a large forest called the haunted forest.

00:01:13.070 --> 00:01:18.830
People used to say that the forest was cursed
and anyone who went there attracted spirits.

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:23.360
One day, Ayano was roaming around the jungle,
collecting birds’ eggs.

00:01:23.360 --> 00:01:28.640
But he had forgotten to go to the toilet before
leaving, so he was struggling to hold it in.

00:01:28.640 --> 00:01:33.330
He tells himself that he can make it home
in time but changes his mind when he sees

00:01:33.330 --> 00:01:35.740
a large egg on the ground.

00:01:35.740 --> 00:01:39.030
He decides to defecate on the egg.

00:01:39.030 --> 00:01:43.950
After that, as he pulls his pants up, he notices
that the egg is half underground.

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:48.170
He starts thinking about why someone buried
such a massive egg instead of bringing it

00:01:48.170 --> 00:01:49.340
home with them.

00:01:49.340 --> 00:01:54.040
Then, he sees the feces on top of the egg
and thinks that defecating on it might be

00:01:54.040 --> 00:01:56.420
weirder than burying it.

00:01:56.420 --> 00:02:00.200
Thinking about a lot of things, he leaves
the jungle for the day.

00:02:00.200 --> 00:02:04.570
Since the thought of the egg never leaves
his mind, Ayano goes back the other day to

00:02:04.570 --> 00:02:05.630
look for it.

00:02:05.630 --> 00:02:10.179
But since he is not familiar with the jungle,
he never finds the egg again.

00:02:10.179 --> 00:02:14.790
However, Ayano doesn’t give up and looks
for the egg every day.

00:02:14.790 --> 00:02:20.750
Until one day, a man with several tattoos
and blood dripping from his body appears in

00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:21.840
front of him.

00:02:21.840 --> 00:02:25.620
Ayano looks at him in fear, but the man doesn’t
say anything.

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:28.750
From that day onwards, he sees the man everywhere.

00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:35.170
At first, Ayano is terrified and bothered
by the stranger following him, but with time,

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:37.170
he gets used to being followed.

00:02:37.170 --> 00:02:40.860
He also mentions that the stranger had his
feces on his head.

00:02:40.860 --> 00:02:46.069
One day, when Ayano was able to do a flip
on the playground bar, the man disappeared

00:02:46.069 --> 00:02:48.080
and never came back again.

00:02:48.080 --> 00:02:52.760
Sachiko also contemplates learning to do a
backflip to get rid of the giant.

00:02:52.760 --> 00:02:57.530
But what she doesn’t know is that the day
the man stopped following Ayano, the police

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:01.810
had found a skull buried in the forest with
feces on top of it.

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:07.360
So, it turns out the egg Ayano defecated on
was actually a human skull.

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:12.620
In the following scene, we see Sachiko’s
elder brother Hajime in his school.

00:03:12.620 --> 00:03:16.670
He has a love letter in his hands, addressed
to him by some girl.

00:03:16.670 --> 00:03:19.870
She calls him to meet in a restaurant after
school.

00:03:19.870 --> 00:03:25.000
Later, we see four of Hajime’s in the said
restaurant talking about girls.

00:03:25.000 --> 00:03:27.010
One of them is dressed as a girl as well.

00:03:27.010 --> 00:03:32.230
As they talk, we find out that the love letter
was actually left by them so they can prank

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:33.500
Hajime.

00:03:33.500 --> 00:03:38.610
Just then, Hajime cycles towards the restaurant,
and the boys get ready to prank him.

00:03:38.610 --> 00:03:43.900
However, to their disappointment, he cycles
to his home without stopping by the restaurant.

00:03:43.900 --> 00:03:49.440
A voice narrates to us that Hajime has lost
his faith in relationships after he heard

00:03:49.440 --> 00:03:54.819
a couple fighting about cosmetic surgeries
in a restaurant and after he saw a guy who

00:03:54.819 --> 00:03:56.840
was beaten by his girlfriend.

00:03:56.840 --> 00:04:02.290
Next, we see Hajime and Sachiko’s mother
Yoshiko at her job.

00:04:02.290 --> 00:04:05.440
She works as a designer in animated film projects.

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:09.400
Her boss is a pervert who wants to get together
with Yoshiko.

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:13.240
That day he scolds a worker for bringing her
pet to work.

00:04:13.240 --> 00:04:18.669
Later at night, everyone is at home when the
father, Nobuo, plays a board game called Go

00:04:18.669 --> 00:04:19.930
with Hajime.

00:04:19.930 --> 00:04:24.080
The boy has been playing the game for a long
time and is getting quite good at it.

00:04:24.080 --> 00:04:29.770
The next day at school, a student named Suzuishi
is transferred to Hajime’s class.

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:34.479
He instantly develops feelings for the girl
but is too shy to even talk to her.

00:04:34.479 --> 00:04:41.930
After school, we see grandfather Akira, Ayano,
Sachiko, and mother Yoshiko drinking tea together.

00:04:41.930 --> 00:04:45.900
They stay in silence for a very long time,
enjoying the beverage.

00:04:45.900 --> 00:04:50.770
Sometime later, Sachiko runs to the living
room and stares into nothingness.

00:04:50.770 --> 00:04:55.160
Her giant doppelganger is also beside her,
sitting in silence.

00:04:55.160 --> 00:05:00.439
Fed up with the giant, she finally decides
to learn to do a backflip on a bar and get

00:05:00.439 --> 00:05:01.439
rid of it.

00:05:01.439 --> 00:05:06.020
She runs to a restricted area nearby, where
lies a deserted playground.

00:05:06.020 --> 00:05:11.129
However, she looks at the playing bar for
a long time and returns back home without

00:05:11.129 --> 00:05:12.610
trying to play on it.

00:05:12.610 --> 00:05:18.270
The following day at school, a girl asks the
new transfer student, Suzuishi, what club

00:05:18.270 --> 00:05:20.879
she will choose for after-school practice.

00:05:20.879 --> 00:05:25.360
Suzuishi says that she wants to join the board
game “Go” club.

00:05:25.360 --> 00:05:30.979
Hajime hears this and is over the moon, knowing
that he and Suzuishi share an interest.

00:05:30.979 --> 00:05:35.439
On his way back home, he cycles while fantasizing
about Suzuishi.

00:05:35.439 --> 00:05:41.319
Later, when he is alone in his room, Hajime
fantasizes an elaborate fake scenario and

00:05:41.319 --> 00:05:44.500
fights imaginary men to save his “girl.”

00:05:44.500 --> 00:05:47.800
In the following scene, he is back in school
that evening.

00:05:47.800 --> 00:05:52.520
Suzuishi is with her friend talking as he
spies on her from afar.

00:05:52.520 --> 00:05:56.860
After a while, he meets his father while returning
home on a metro.

00:05:56.860 --> 00:06:02.719
They both witness two men in some kind of
costumes making noise and clicking pictures.

00:06:02.719 --> 00:06:07.020
When they get off the metro, the men get in
a fight with some strangers, and the father

00:06:07.020 --> 00:06:09.469
and the son run away from the scene.

00:06:09.469 --> 00:06:14.650
Now, the family is at the dinner table as
the two tell them what they saw in the metro.

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:18.990
Ayano almost doesn’t believe them because
of the absurdity of the incident.

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:23.259
The next day, the mother of the family Yoshiko
is at work.

00:06:23.259 --> 00:06:28.479
Before leaving, she asks her boss not to call
her the following day because she is on a

00:06:28.479 --> 00:06:29.479
leave.

00:06:29.479 --> 00:06:32.050
It is evident that he has been bothering her
to go out with him.

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:36.740
He promises to leave her alone but as soon
as she leaves, he calls her husband and tells

00:06:36.740 --> 00:06:38.979
him Yoshiko is cheating on him.

00:06:38.979 --> 00:06:44.259
Yoshiko, who is just outside the door, hears
this and attacks her boss for spreading rumors

00:06:44.259 --> 00:06:45.309
about her.

00:06:45.309 --> 00:06:50.759
Cut to the next scene, Sachiko wakes up to
a nightmare of her and her doppelganger swimming

00:06:50.759 --> 00:06:51.759
together.

00:06:51.759 --> 00:06:56.430
She runs to the abandoned playground again
and gets on the play bar for the first time.

00:06:56.430 --> 00:07:01.520
At the same time, Ayano goes to a shop owned
by his ex-girlfriend, who is now married to

00:07:01.520 --> 00:07:02.639
another man.

00:07:02.639 --> 00:07:07.710
He talks to her awkwardly at first but then
opens up and says he is glad she is happy

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:08.899
in her life.

00:07:08.899 --> 00:07:14.520
The girl says the same, and the two separate
after getting a closure of their relationship.

00:07:14.520 --> 00:07:17.720
After that, he lays by the side of a river
to relax.

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:22.189
He notices a man his age dancing nearby and
befriends him.

00:07:22.189 --> 00:07:27.610
The next day, Yoshiko gets a call from her
boss, who wants uncle Ayano’s help.

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:32.899
Since Ayano is a manga artist and a record
producer, he wants him to record a song.

00:07:32.899 --> 00:07:36.740
He even invites grandfather Akira to be in
his music video.

00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:42.159
At first, Ayano declines to record his song,
but he eventually agrees after the family

00:07:42.159 --> 00:07:43.460
asks him to.

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:49.240
The grandfather is very happy to be a part
of the song and begins singing day and night.

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:54.529
Later that day, Sachiko is in her classroom,
and her giant companion is watching her while

00:07:54.529 --> 00:07:56.659
lying on the school’s playground.

00:07:56.659 --> 00:08:01.360
After school, she goes to the playground again
to practice backflipping.

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:05.979
This time, her grandfather watches her from
afar and is relieved that she isn’t doing

00:08:05.979 --> 00:08:07.449
something harmful.

00:08:07.449 --> 00:08:09.509
He leaves soon after.

00:08:09.509 --> 00:08:13.270
At night, Ayano brings his new friend over
for dinner.

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:18.789
After dinner, the family sits together as
the father Nobuo, who happens to be a hypnotherapist,

00:08:18.789 --> 00:08:22.139
performs a procedure on everyone to make them
relax.

00:08:22.139 --> 00:08:27.949
He tries to hypnotize everyone, but it only
works on Yoshiko, Ayano, and his new friend.

00:08:27.949 --> 00:08:31.370
The three fall unconscious while sitting up.

00:08:31.370 --> 00:08:35.839
After a while, they regain their consciousness
and say that they feel rejuvenated.

00:08:35.839 --> 00:08:40.919
The mother, Yoshiko, explains to her daughter
how it feels to be hypnotized since she didn’t

00:08:40.919 --> 00:08:42.990
get to enjoy the experience.

00:08:42.990 --> 00:08:46.739
She describes it as being able to move freely
into space.

00:08:46.739 --> 00:08:51.889
The next day, Hajime goes to the library to
return some books on the board game “Go.”

00:08:51.889 --> 00:08:56.589
The members of the “Go” club notice his
interest and invite him to join the club since

00:08:56.589 --> 00:08:58.459
they are low on members.

00:08:58.459 --> 00:09:02.269
Hajime shyly accepts the offer and goes to
the club with them.

00:09:02.269 --> 00:09:04.029
Suzuishi is there too.

00:09:04.029 --> 00:09:08.850
He plays a game against a boy and easily wins
it as Suzuishi watches.

00:09:08.850 --> 00:09:12.519
However, she leaves right after without talking
to him.

00:09:12.519 --> 00:09:17.589
At the same time, Sachiko is at the playground
practicing doing a backflip when a man’s

00:09:17.589 --> 00:09:19.710
head emerges from the ground.

00:09:19.710 --> 00:09:23.730
Sachiko runs away in fear and is caught by
two men.

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:26.110
She tells them about the “mud man.”

00:09:26.110 --> 00:09:30.050
The three return back to the playground and
rescue the man who claims he had been stuck

00:09:30.050 --> 00:09:31.800
underground for three days.

00:09:31.800 --> 00:09:36.480
At night, she tells the story to her mother
and two of her co-workers who have come over

00:09:36.480 --> 00:09:37.670
for dinner.

00:09:37.670 --> 00:09:42.630
Some days later, Ayano records a song for
Akira and Yoshiko’s boss.

00:09:42.630 --> 00:09:48.480
After listening to the awful song, Ayano and
his co-workers are shown flying to the sky.

00:09:48.480 --> 00:09:54.790
One day at school, Suzuishi is playing a game
of Go with a friend but he leaves midway.

00:09:54.790 --> 00:09:57.690
As she packs up, Hajime enters the room.

00:09:57.690 --> 00:10:03.259
He sees she is alone and is about to leave
but Suzuishi challenges him to a game of Go.

00:10:03.259 --> 00:10:05.630
The two begin to play in silence.

00:10:05.630 --> 00:10:11.399
All of a sudden, Hajime tells Suzuishi that
it was his dream to play a match of Go with

00:10:11.399 --> 00:10:12.399
her.

00:10:12.399 --> 00:10:15.470
Suzuishi then tells him that they should play
every day.

00:10:15.470 --> 00:10:19.070
After the game, they leave the school together
under the same umbrella.

00:10:19.070 --> 00:10:23.550
Hajime is over the moon to finally be able
to talk to his crush.

00:10:23.550 --> 00:10:28.040
The next day at work, Yoshiko presents her
animation to her coworkers.

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:32.399
It is inspired by the feelings she goes through
when she is hypnotized.

00:10:32.399 --> 00:10:37.050
Everyone loves the animation and claps for
Yoshiko in appreciation.

00:10:37.050 --> 00:10:42.800
Back at home, Sachiko peeps into her grandfather’s
room to see him lying limp on the floor.

00:10:42.800 --> 00:10:48.220
In the following scene, we see the whole family
in a metro, returning home after the grandfather’s

00:10:48.220 --> 00:10:49.220
funeral.

00:10:49.220 --> 00:10:55.079
Later, the four of them sit at the front porch
and drink tea in silence, remembering the

00:10:55.079 --> 00:10:56.079
grandfather.

00:10:56.079 --> 00:11:00.199
Then, they go into his study room and look
through his belongings.

00:11:00.199 --> 00:11:04.310
To their surprise, they find sketchbooks with
paintings of the whole family.

00:11:04.310 --> 00:11:10.250
In the paintings, Yoshiko is seen walking
with an umbrella, Nobuo is running, Hajime

00:11:10.250 --> 00:11:15.350
is on his bicycle while Sachiko is doing a
backflip on a playing bar.

00:11:15.350 --> 00:11:21.579
In the following scene, we see Hajime with
Suzuishi playing Go while talking to her confidently.

00:11:21.579 --> 00:11:26.630
Yoshiko is working on her animations while
Sachiko is in the playground attempting to

00:11:26.630 --> 00:11:28.100
do a backflip.

00:11:28.100 --> 00:11:32.500
She finally manages to do one and freezes
in shock.

00:11:32.500 --> 00:11:37.610
Just then, her giant self emerges from the
ground and flies away to the sky.

00:11:37.610 --> 00:11:43.649
A giant sunflower also emerges from the same
place and engulfs Sachiko.

00:11:43.649 --> 00:11:49.850
It grows bigger and bigger, ultimately taking
over the whole world and turning into dust.

00:11:49.850 --> 00:11:53.790
At last, Sachiko levitates back to the playground.

00:11:53.790 --> 00:11:58.670
The movie ends as we are shown all the characters
of the movie watching the beautiful sunset.

00:11:58.670 --> 00:12:02.889
Unlike the typical type of dysfunctional families
that are shown in most movies, the taste of

00:12:02.889 --> 00:12:03.889
tea doesn’t have any dramatic encounters.

00:12:03.889 --> 00:12:04.889
In fact, it is made in such a way that the
viewers would find the encounters between

00:12:04.889 --> 00:12:05.889
the characters relatable to their life.

00:12:05.889 --> 00:12:06.889
Modern films have been pushing dystopia and
pessimism to the viewers while this movie

00:12:06.889 --> 00:12:07.889
shows that not everything about reality is
always negative.

00:12:07.889 --> 00:12:08.889
The movie looks uncomplicated and straightforward
in the first look but has several metaphors

00:12:08.889 --> 00:12:09.889
and hidden messages throughout it.

00:12:09.889 --> 00:12:10.889
Some viewers believe that Sachiko seeing her
giant self following her is her creating fantasies

00:12:10.889 --> 00:12:11.889
because she is frustrated by the time it takes
for her to grow up.

00:12:11.889 --> 00:12:12.889
So, she keeps herself entertained by trying
to get rid of the giant.

00:12:12.889 --> 00:12:13.889
